# NOTE:   srs_dyn_sign_cond_side_block_hoist_no_sink — COPY not hoisted; MOVX stays in bb.4.
# NOTE:   srs_dyn_sign_cond_latch_is_exit — MOVX not sunk to exit bb.3.
# NOTE:   srs_dyn_sign_nested_multiblock_inner — duplicate MOVX at outer exit bb.5.
# NOTE:   srs_dyn_sign_two_inner_loops — inner loop B COPY not hoisted to bb.4 preheader.
# NOTE:   srs_dyn_sign_outer_if_inner_loop — outer COPY at inner preheader bb.2, not bb.0.
# NOTE: Sink blocked by isRegLiveInAtInLoopSuccessor (not header ReservedLiveins):
# NOTE:   srs_dyn_sign_cond_livein_opposite_branch, srs_dyn_sign_cond_side_block_hoist_no_sink.

