# bb.0 and bb.5 are both outside preds of loop header bb.2; there is no single
# preheader. runOnLoop returns early when !L.getLoopPreheader().
# Expected: no transformation — COPY and MOV stay in the loop.
---
name:            srs_dyn_sign_no_preheader
